## 5. Service layer method

`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicServiceImpl.java:232-237`:
```java
@Override
@Transactional
public void saveOwner(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException {
    ownerRepository.save(owner);
}
```
The `@Transactional` here is the transaction boundary for the insert. Interface declaration: `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicService.java` (method `saveOwner`). No other service logic, no notifications, no audit-field setting.

