## 6. Repository method

Interface — `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/OwnerRepository.java:66`:
```java
void save(Owner owner) throws DataAccessException;
```

Runtime implementation under the active `spring-data-jpa` profile — `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/repository/springdatajpa/SpringDataOwnerRepository.java:36-37`:
```java
@Profile("spring-data-jpa")
public interface SpringDataOwnerRepository extends OwnerRepository, Repository<Owner, Integer> {
```
`save` is not overridden here, so it resolves to Spring Data's `SimpleJpaRepository.save`, which does `entityManager.persist` for a new entity (`isNew()` true) or `merge` otherwise. (Alternative non-active impls exist for other profiles: `repository/jpa/JpaOwnerRepositoryImpl.java` and `repository/jdbc/JdbcOwnerRepositoryImpl.java`.)

